ParallelHue attribution
=======================

This project is informed by ParallelHue, an MIT-licensed open-source project:
https://github.com/hikarioyama/ParallelHue

The dashboard uses a small, compatible adapter for ParallelHue's published
StepEvent semantics (explicit exact telemetry versus SSE chunk mode). No
ParallelHue source files are copied into this project.

